    "label": "12",
    "prompt": "Let $A$ and $B$ be sets. Prove De Morgan’s Laws:\n$$\\begin{aligned}(A\\cup B)'&=A'\\cap B'\\\\(A\\cap B)'&=A'\\cup B'\\end{aligned}$$",
